---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const path = '/tarot-love-reading';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Tarot Love Reading — Daily Cards for Relationships"
  description="Use daily tarot for love and relationships. What the cards say about your heart today."
  path={path}
>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Daily Tarot for Love</h1>
    <p>
      A daily love reading isn't fortune-telling — it's a daily check-in with what your heart already knows.
    </p>
    <p>
      The best cards for love questions are in the suit of Cups and the Major Arcana: <em>The Lovers</em>,
      <em>Two of Cups</em>, <em>The Empress</em>, <em>The Emperor</em>, and the court cards of Cups.
    </p>
    <p>
      When you draw your nine cards today, look for Cups cards in the relationship positions: The Present,
      The Self, and The Outcome. They speak loudest about love.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a class="btn" href="/">Draw today's love reading →</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
